    IMPACT_REVIEW --> FOLLOWUP_REVIEW: window and samples pass
    IMPACT_REVIEW --> BLOCKED_IMPACT: window or samples short
    FOLLOWUP_REVIEW --> LEARNING_REVIEW: owners and due times pass
    FOLLOWUP_REVIEW --> FOLLOWUP_BLOCKED: missing or overdue work
    LEARNING_REVIEW --> APPROVAL_REVIEW: postmortem and pack bound
    LEARNING_REVIEW --> LEARNING_BLOCKED: digest or status drift
    APPROVAL_REVIEW --> CLOSEOUT_ELIGIBLE: role, scope, age pass
    APPROVAL_REVIEW --> APPROVAL_BLOCKED: approval invalid
    CLOSEOUT_ELIGIBLE --> HUMAN_CLOSEOUT: owner decides
    HUMAN_CLOSEOUT --> [*]
